<style>
 #pm-{{ section.id }} { background: #fff; }
 #pm-{{ section.id }} .g { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 0.9fr 1.1fr; gap: clamp(28px,5vw,72px); align-items: center; }
 #pm-{{ section.id }} h2 { font-size: clamp(28px,3.4vw,40px); line-height: 1.12; margin: 14px 0 0; }
 #pm-{{ section.id }} .copy p { font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--ink-2); margin: 0 0 18px; }
 #pm-{{ section.id }} .copy p:last-child { margin: 0; }
 #pm-{{ section.id }} .visual { position: relative; padding: 40px; display: grid; place-items: center; }
 #pm-{{ section.id }} .visual::before { content: ""; position: absolute; inset: 50% auto auto 50%; width: 86%; aspect-ratio: 1; transform: translate(-50%, -50%); border-radius: 50%; background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 45%, rgba(197,162,83,.16) 0%, rgba(28,78,128,.07) 42%, rgba(255,255,255,0) 70%); z-index: 0; }
 #pm-{{ section.id }} .visual svg { position: relative; z-index: 1; width: 78%; height: auto; filter: drop-shadow(0 14px 30px rgba(11,31,58,.10)); }
 #pm-{{ section.id }} .stats { display: flex; gap: 40px; margin-top: 26px; padding-top: 22px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
 #pm-{{ section.id }} .stats .n { font-size: 30px; font-weight: 800; color: var(--ink); line-height: 1; }
 #pm-{{ section.id }} .stats .l { margin-top: 7px; font-size: 13px; color: var(--muted); }
 @media (max-width: 749px){ #pm-{{ section.id }} .g { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 28px; } #pm-{{ section.id }} .visual { order: -1; } }
</style>
<section id="pm-{{ section.id }}" class="ip6 ip6-bright ip6-section ip6-reveal">
 <div class="ip6-wrap g">
 <div class="visual ip6-rise d1">
 <svg viewBox="0 0 320 320" fill="none" stroke="#0b1f3a" stroke-width="1.4" aria-hidden="true">
 <polygon points="160,40 264,100 264,220 160,280 56,220 56,100" stroke="#c5a253"/>
 <g stroke="#1c4e80" stroke-opacity=".55">
 <line x1="160" y1="160" x2="160" y2="40"/><line x1="160" y1="160" x2="264" y2="100"/><line x1="160" y1="160" x2="264" y2="220"/>
 <line x1="160" y1="160" x2="160" y2="280"/><line x1="160" y1="160" x2="56" y2="220"/><line x1="160" y1="160" x2="56" y2="100"/>
 </g>
 <circle cx="160" cy="160" r="12" fill="#0b1f3a"/>
 <circle cx="160" cy="40" r="8" fill="#c5a253"/><circle cx="264" cy="100" r="8" fill="#c5a253"/><circle cx="264" cy="220" r="8" fill="#c5a253"/>
 <circle cx="160" cy="280" r="8" fill="#c5a253"/><circle cx="56" cy="220" r="8" fill="#c5a253"/><circle cx="56" cy="100" r="8" fill="#c5a253"/>
 </svg>
 </div>
 <div class="ip6-rise d2">
 <span class="ip6-eyebrow">First, the molecule</span>
 <h2>IP6 is a molecule, not a marketing term.</h2>
 <div class="copy" style="margin-top:18px">
 <p>IP6, inositol hexaphosphate, is a naturally occurring compound found in whole grains and legumes, and the molecule at the center of Prof. Shamsuddin's research into cellular health.</p>
 <p>IP6 Original pairs standardized, research-grade IP6 with Inositol in a clean, high-purity formulation, the form the research described, without unnecessary additives.</p>
 </div>
 <div class="stats">
 <div><div class="n"><span data-spec-ip6>{{ product.selected_or_first_available_variant.metafields.ip6.ip6_mg.value | default: 786 }}</span> mg</div><div class="l">IP6 per serving</div></div>
 <div><div class="n"><span data-spec-inositol>{{ product.selected_or_first_available_variant.metafields.ip6.inositol_mg.value | default: 216 }}</span> mg</div><div class="l">Inositol per serving</div></div>
 <div><div class="n"><span data-spec-servings>{{ product.selected_or_first_available_variant.metafields.ip6.servings.value | default: 60 }}</span></div><div class="l">Servings</div></div>
 </div>
 </div>
 </div>
</section>
{% schema %}
{ "name": "IP6 PDP Molecule", "tag": "section", "settings": [], "presets": [{ "name": "IP6 PDP Molecule" }] }
{% endschema %}
